---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="What this site is for.">
  <h1>About</h1>

  <div class="essay">
    <p>
      This is where I write down what I am learning about building software and building a
      business. Writing forces me to find out whether I understand something or only
      recognize it.
    </p>
    <p>
      The software articles are about the practical parts: how decisions get made, how work
      gets shipped, and what tends to go wrong. The business articles are about customers,
      pricing, operations, and the reasoning behind those choices.
    </p>
    <p>
      Nothing here is meant to be final. When experience changes my mind I would rather
      revise an article than defend it. If something seems wrong, it may well be.
    </p>
    <p>
      The site is plain on purpose. You can read the newest work on the
      <a href="/articles">articles page</a> or subscribe by <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
